47999745061_578053030789274776_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6k7msAnkdZAQ7kNvwHn2NjE&_nc_oc=Adr4kSeiGu_LiZ-5KJ1l8Mt3TrKftWC16ZNi5SpAnxRKHLMDJyfIblPq7ewfxwt2EYw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBbshiOcYvJHSovqJ56OMQyeOEkmeFxuRR7vgYW8Qf22A&oe=6A65F092"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "2188384618598603", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618938_2188384621931936_2227680298010489705_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9qoul3Cex88Q7kNvwFExbYP&_nc_oc=Adq4FLvD3UCD7Lk3Tck36CTwc1rVwfEvAxT3_ctzWkV72B1qubMyyNP0aphZpzALAaU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCfgyqCFmsTASWw0CDBhhoJXi8sy4jn3xjVQu6pOzCW1g&oe=6A661489"}, "display_name": "Battle Fit: VR Cardio Boxing", "keywords": ["Boxing", "Cardio", "Fitness", "Workout", "Exercise"], "long_description": "# Turn Combat into Your Personal Workout Routine! \u26a1\n\nReady to turn your screen time into movement? **Battle Fit** is designed to make fitness fun and accessible. Step into the ring for a quick, high-energy session that leaves you feeling great. \n\n# \ud83d\udd25Key Features:\n* **\ud83e\udd4a Timed Boxing Rounds** Flexible match lengths to fit your daily routine.\n* **\ud83e\udd16 Varied Opponent Roster:** Multiple CPU fighters with distinct challenges to keep training fresh.\n* **\ud83d\udcc8Calorie-conscious:** Check your session summary after the fight to see how much energy you\u2019ve burned. Your progress is personal and rewarding. \n* **\ud83d\udca6 Full-Body Workout:** Designed to get you sweating, burning, and feeling like a pro.\n\n**Ready to get started? Lace up your gloves and join the fun today! \ud83c\udfc6**", "short_description": "Punch, sweat, and conquer! \ud83e\udd4a Battle Fit is your ultimate VR boxing arena where combat meets intense cardio. Face diverse CPU challengers with unique patterns that keep your workout fresh and exciti